  user_2,[01:30] All set, Samar. Your policy status is now Active.
  user_1,Great! Thank you. Can you also confirm the sum assured and the premium amount?
  user_2,Sure, the sum assured is 10 lakh rupees and the annual premium is 12,500 INR, effective from 01/10/2026.
  user_1,Got it. Thanks for the help. Bye.
